What was taken: src/, resources/, README.md, Cargo.toml.orig and the
Cargo.toml published to crates.io for 9.0.1, plus an empty [workspace] table.

Marquee changes (each changed spot carries a "Marquee fork" comment), for
the torrent address policy (plans/c27-torrent-policy.md, appendix A.1):

- src/tracker_comms_udp.rs: `Policy { permits, resolver }`, held by
  `UdpTrackerClient` (a new argument of `new`, read with `policy()`).
  `request` refuses a destination outside it before `send_to`, so a
  literal, a fresh answer and a cached one (`prev_addrs`) all meet the
  current interface snapshot.
- src/tracker_comms.rs: UDP tracker names resolve through the policy's
  resolver, which keeps only permitted answers; every HTTP announce whose
  host is an IP literal is checked against the policy before it is sent.
- src/lib.rs: re-exports `Policy` and `AnnounceFields`.
